<title>UK: Russia prices $2.0 billion 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Russia prices $2.0 billion 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers J.P. Morgan Securities and SBC Warburg, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RUSSIA</p>
<p> AMT	  $2.0 BLN  COUPON     10.00     MATURITY    26.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.164    PAY DATE    26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.164    SPREAD	+375 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
